            "Use a standard as a reference for what to cover, and a methodology or framework for how to do it. Most organisations tailor a methodology so that it meets the standard their sponsors or clients expect. Read our guide to the [PMBOK Guide](/project-management/pmbok-guide/) and the comparison of [PMBOK vs PRINCE2](/project-management/pmbok-vs-prince2/).",
